        <div class="faq">
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary>Do you work with new businesses and startups?</summary>
            <p>Yes, and I love it. If you're just getting started, I can help with everything you need to launch online: your website, a Google Business Profile, lead forms and the SEO basics, explained in plain English so nothing feels overwhelming.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary>How much does a website cost?</summary>
            <p>Every project is different, so I don't do one-size-fits-all pricing. After a free review of your needs, you'll get a clear proposal with the price and scope before any work starts.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary>How long does it take?</summary>
            <p>A simple business site can go live in a few weeks; larger sites and web apps take longer. Your proposal will include a timeline so you know exactly when to expect each step.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary>What's included in the free site review?</summary>
            <p>I'll look at your current site's design, mobile experience, speed and SEO basics, then send you a short list of what's holding it back and how to fix it. There's no obligation.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary>Will my site show up on Google?</summary>
            <p>Every site I build includes technical SEO: fast load times, clean structure, proper page titles and descriptions, structured data, a sitemap and Google Search Console setup. Rankings take time, but you'll be starting on the right foot. <a class="inline" href="/seo-for-small-business/">More about my SEO services</a>.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary>Can you connect my forms, funnels or email list?</summary>
            <p>Yes. I can build on platforms like ClickFunnels, GoHighLevel or Leadpages, or create custom forms that forward every lead to your inbox, CRM or email list.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary>How can AI help my business?</summary>
            <p>It depends on your business. Common wins are automating repetitive admin, routing and summarizing leads, drafting content, and smart search or support features. I'll only recommend AI where it saves you real time or money.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary>Do you only work with US clients?</summary>
            <p>Not at all. I've worked with clients all over the world, including Vietnam, Scotland, Indonesia, the Philippines and Colombia. Everything is done remotely, and I'm happy to schedule calls around your time zone.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

